# Build trees
build-wsl/
build-cuda/
build-werror/
build/
out/

# llama.cpp fetched source and tarballs (pinned commit, fetched by CMake)
third_party/
llama-src*/

# Models and datasets are fetched by scripts/download_model.sh, never
# committed (license + size).
*.gguf
models/

# Logs and scratch output
*.log
nohup.out
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Experiment scratch directories (reports under benchmarks/results/exp*/
# are committed; transient dumps are not)
benchmarks/results/exp-dump*/

# Local verification trees (AR009)
build-asan/
build-clean/
models

# AR013: the 64K NIAH contexts are 1.6 MB of synthetic text that Gitee's WAF
# rejects on push. They are generated deterministically by
# `gen_niah.py --cases 4 --words 57000` (pinned seed), which `repro.sh ar013`
# runs before the matrix; index.tsv and manifest.json (with the per-file
# SHA256) stay in the repository so the expected content is verifiable.
benchmarks/data/explen/len64k/contexts/

# Local agent instructions (not published)
AGENTS.md
